CsCode — tree-sitter bundle (the "tree-sitter" folder next to the application)
=============================================================================

This folder holds third-party software compiled or copied, unmodified, from the pinned sources listed in bundle.json
(tools/treesitter/manifest.json in the CsCode repository). The full licence text of every source, and the NOTICE file of each source that
has one, is in licenses/<source>.txt.

1. The tree-sitter runtime (lib/): https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2018 Max Brunsfeld.
   Compiled from the tagged release named in bundle.json.

2. Grammars (grammars/<name>.so|.dylib|.dll): each compiled from its project's src/ directory at the commit nvim-treesitter pins.
   MIT License: tree-sitter-asm, -bash, -c, -c-sharp, -cmake, -cpp, -css, -csv, -go, -graphql, -haskell, -html, -java, -javascript,
   -jsdoc, -json, -kotlin, -lua, -markdown, -nasm, -nix, -ocaml, -proto, -python, -regex, -rst, -rust, -scala, -scss, -svelte, -toml,
   -typescript, -vue, -yaml, -zig.
   Apache License 2.0: tree-sitter-elixir (Copyright 2021 The Elixir Team; its NOTICE says the generated files in src/ are
   Copyright (c) 2018-2021 Max Brunsfeld under the MIT License), tree-sitter-erlang (WhatsApp), tree-sitter-hcl (tree-sitter-grammars).

3. Queries (grammars/queries/<name>/*.scm): copied unmodified from nvim-treesitter (https://github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter,
   runtime/queries/) at the commit named in bundle.json.
