   distributed on an "AS IS" BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied. See the License for the
   specific language governing permissions and limitations under the License.

CsCode reads these files at run time; it does not change them. No GPL-, LGPL-, EUPL- or otherwise copyleft-licensed source is part of the
bundle (build-grammars.sh refuses any licence outside MIT, Apache-2.0, ISC, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, 0BSD and CC0-1.0).
